{"id":"n57301-3-6","stage":0,"title":"반 · 班","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57301-3-6-1","ko":"학교에 여학생 반은 몇 반이나 있어?","zh":"学校里女生班级一共有几个啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학교에","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여학생","meaning":"女学生，女生","explanation":"여학생：女学生，女生","readings":[{"term":"여학생","audio":"/audio/873a9297a28de6cc39d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58152","senseId":"1","lemma":"여학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반은","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반이나","meaning":"班","explanation":"반：班；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"3","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"873a9297a28de6cc","term":"여학생","zh":"女学生，女生","audio":"/audio/873a9297a28de6cc39d8.mp3","entryId":"58152","definition":"女性学生。","pronunciation":["여학쌩"]},